<title>USA: Sears interested in acquiring MaxServ.</title>
<headline>Sears interested in acquiring MaxServ.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>MaxServ Inc said Thursday that Sears, Roebuck and Co had expressed an interest in buying all outstanding shares of MaxServ.</p>
<p>Sears currently owns 64 percent of MaxServ's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>A special committee will be designated by MaxServ to evaluate and negotiate any offer received from Sears, MaxServ said.</p>
<p>There are no assurances that any transaction will be concluded, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
